---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SiteNav from "../components/SiteNav.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About | Regex Cheat Sheet"
  description="Learn about regexsheet, the free, open-source, and lightning-fast regular expression reference maintained by Pritam Dhara and the community."
>
  <SiteNav />

  <main id="main-content" class="container-wide main-prose">
    <div class="prose-wrapper">
      <h1 class="page-title">About regexsheet</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">A fast, free, and open-source reference for regular expressions.</p>

      <div class="content-block">
        <h2>The Mission</h2>
        <p>
          Regular expressions are universally useful, yet notoriously hard to remember. While there are many regex tools available, we noticed a common problem: they are often bloated with intrusive ads, slow to load, or overly complex for simple reference lookups.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>regexsheet</strong> was built to solve this. Our goal is to provide a frictionless, lightning-fast cheat sheet that developers can keep pinned in their browser tabs. No ads, no paywalls, just clean documentation and practical, real-world examples for every major programming language.
        </p>

        <h2>Open Source & Community</h2>
        <p>
          This project is entirely open-source. We believe that the best developer tools are built by the community, for the community. Whether you want to add a new language recipe, fix a typo, or improve the live tester, your contributions are welcome!
        </p>
        <div class="action-card">
          <p>Want to help make this the best regex reference on the web?</p>
          <a href="https://github.com/pritam1813/regexsheet" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"></path></svg>
            Contribute on GitHub
          </a>
        </div>

        <h2>The Maintainer</h2>
        <p>
          Regex Cheat Sheet is maintained by <strong>Pritam Dhara</strong> alongside open-source contributors. As a developer, Pritam created this tool to scratch his own itch, and decided to share it freely with the world.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can follow or reach out to Pritam on <a href="https://github.com/pritam1813" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">GitHub</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Support the Project</h2>
        <p>
          Maintaining the site, reviewing pull requests, and paying for domain and hosting costs takes time and resources. If you find this cheat sheet useful in your daily work, consider supporting the project. Your donations keep the site fast, updated, and 100% ad-free forever.
        </p>
        <div class="action-card sponsor-card">
          <p>Buy the maintainer a coffee and support the open-source web.</p>
          <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/pritam1813" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-sponsor">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"></path></svg>
            Sponsor on GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <SiteFooter />
</Layout>

<style>
  .main-prose {
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-xxl);
  }

  .prose-wrapper {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs) 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xl) 0;
    padding-bottom: var(--space-md);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .content-block {
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .content-block h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-md) 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  
  .content-block h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .content-block p {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md) 0;
  }

  .content-block strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .text-link {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-border-hover);
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .text-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .action-card {
    background: var(--color-surface-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }
  
  .action-card p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  
  .sponsor-card {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 4%, var(--color-surface-raised));
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 20%, var(--color-border));
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--color-ink);
    color: var(--color-surface);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.1s ease, opacity 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .btn-sponsor {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-on-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.1s ease, filter 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-sponsor:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.1);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .prose-wrapper {
      padding: var(--space-md);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    }
    
    .action-card {
      align-items: stretch;
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .btn-primary, .btn-sponsor {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
